bibit-agenthub-plugin (0.3.5) resolute-porting; urgency=medium

  * Keep Power names on one line: the card title is a fixed 26px box and
    useFittedFontSize shrinks the font size between 19px and 13px to fit the
    name, so long names cannot wrap onto a second line and the card rows line
    up. Measured on the board with the real catalog names.

 -- liangjunzhao <junzhao.liang@spacemit.com>  Thu, 18 Sep 2026 17:05:00 +0800

bibit-agenthub-plugin (0.3.4) resolute-porting; urgency=medium

  * Draw the plugin's own scrollbar indicator. The platform bar cannot be
    styled from a plugin page: the host sets `scrollbar-width: thin` globally,
    which makes WebKit ignore every ::-webkit-scrollbar rule, WebKitGTK ignores
    scrollbar-color, and WebKitGTK never repaints a scrollbar when its style
    changes at runtime (measured on the board, docs 7.2.1). The native bar is
    now hidden on every scroller the plugin owns and ScrollThumb shows position
    while scrolling, then fades out.

 -- liangjunzhao <junzhao.liang@spacemit.com>  Thu, 18 Sep 2026 16:20:00 +0800

bibit-agenthub-plugin (0.3.3) resolute-porting; urgency=medium

  * Every plugin-owned scroller (the page, the description box, both tag rows and
    the details dialog body) now shares one thin scrollbar that stays invisible
    at rest and appears as a position indicator while that scroller moves.

