bibit-agenthub-plugin (0.3.2) resolute-porting; urgency=medium

  * Fix the page scroll for real: the host page box is min-height based, so the
    percentage height of 0.3.1 never resolved and the page grew with its content.
    The page now sizes itself with viewport units (height: 100svh), matching the
    host's own h-svh pages.
  * Show the description as a fixed 5-line box, hide its scrollbar, and clip
    horizontal overflow.

 -- liangjunzhao <junzhao.liang@spacemit.com>  Thu, 18 Sep 2026 13:30:00 +0800

